    "price_cny_per_second 为标准报价估算字段，专属分组实际价以 /api/pricing 或账户页面为准；它不是请求字段。",
    "display_name / groups / price_cny_per_second / capability_modes / reference_limits / switches / prompt_max_characters / reference_rules 均为本站能力描述字段；创建请求只接受 model/prompt/seconds/metadata.{ratio,mode,image_urls,video_urls,audio_urls,first_frame_url,last_frame_url,generate_audio,face_mode}。",
    "upload_limits 为全局上传规则；request_fields 列出请求面字段白名单。"
